#: scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e62070e578a68a8ad8265c87bb1b1de918062d35b7c231438c0000bec0d05d8
#. default-sha256: e1c3a447432ffa9bba6bdf91523df7ddac700fa1db712405e59b3bb47f3e7110
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Before long, winter retreated and our second spring came "
"to take its place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫やがて、⟪k:8⟫冬も過ぎ――二度目の春が訪れる。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ed57a95ddcbe12d4aefaedf629be907e1a8049c7bf857dc1e958890b74c05a5
#. default-sha256: a4ffcce27c3ab72a7983c212148a88b2e734fc87f73e1d84e18b6bb5b69edab7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A full year had passed since we had resumed living together,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女と私が、⟪k:1⟫再び生活を始めてから、⟪k:2⟫一年が経った。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 294be152491a3463e998ac530658b2fff1b36241d6f47411377d88c024baed04
#. default-sha256: 9cf0b3e4db4e2bcad9efcc2bf0f0e5c979a21d53cf895bd0f38fbeaaa9bb2852
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4A897F4C_E0E2_415A_A9A0_1CCB1D2596EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I don’t think it was my imagination that this year felt much warmer than last."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一年前と比べてずいぶん気温があたたかく感じたのは、⟪k:1⟫恐らく、⟪k:2⟫気の所為ではなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 154773923bd7546087d2164af6e0f85b4e5d7fb2530b026c16023b2b934ea2c2
#. default-sha256: 742c88cda715e7244965c99ee02ce4db13fe7d820897f81411cb81b5b6ea12a7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_428E1259_31F0_4BC3_A73C_8A6F40A6E566"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One night, when the breeze carried on it a pleasant residual warmth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫例年より春の訪れが早かったのだろう。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫うららかな陽気の名残を思わせる、⟪k:3⟫柔い風が吹"
"く夜に――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc1cb4b4029a548a180393df8b810cdc921acd7c0e53a8f8e175aee5af5fff9c
#. default-sha256: 15c147e7ac3d36068a4ca67149a274c6e4e69f502eb0503ecc613daa389f78fd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B6FBF873_546C_419B_B190_E0FE79CA05FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Giselle escorted me out to the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ジゼルは、⟪k:1⟫私を庭へと案内した。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd422d5af555ed1ac20661301469a7fd4fa8f504519b45be4d613f18af64ac12
#. default-sha256: e75769f9f77ec8b1d162c5ffebf8cd27e2899b93dc7c64074c28c3a003293670
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_45A3DCF0_F746_44F4_8DD0_2876BDAE6D14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come on, Master! Hurry up!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫旦那さま！　⟪k:3⟫早く、⟪k:4⟫早く！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83e1ef1af711550cfa8d533bd13dd0365d880e5c2cfe27e51f90a7bcce7878e1
#. default-sha256: 184f6fa2d5e64e61e69291dce225506ddb8c906166ebc6d490782462b72e6693
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_04A9B3BA_9BD2_4765_9F52_2D74F2237B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s the middle of the night... ⟪k:1⟫What’s so important..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何だというのです、⟪k:1⟫こんな夜に……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b600cf708887bd9855cb47f4962090bba7e18b04e3a0631c2ff4f9432f48c63e
#. default-sha256: 6892312935665faf720fe01c319280f7ee2ae4f21124e44d0e6daf34f8cf38a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD08FE95_5669_41DF_8099_3B0D7A8EA63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just found it myself!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And I couldn’t wait until morning!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だって、⟪k:1⟫わたしもさっき気づいたんですもの！　⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そうしたら、⟪k:4⟫明日まで待ってい"
"られなくて――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7df4e28ef3315e5e0edff45aafd87efc3c1d9ab5109e88b543535f1b5f4faf90
#. default-sha256: 66cd73ba05b87685547741af59a39303c44b266f9eace1508803de14e470c131
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73838757_5AED_47ED_8910_ADF274AB88A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4df15c07aa09a63a449c25ad2362a7339356c887cde1f9612c0cf477ee98076b
#. default-sha256: b0e6c3c34c6df7d766ebfa3a34eb9ac29a0ea3f46c1ed1255debb44cdffcf0d5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A960CF7C_B617_45A5_A28C_256419E3CA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose! It blossomed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫咲いたんです！　⟪k:1⟫薔薇！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b76aa6da4098b0ec453fced750aa2a54e287c89a830eeb357ba2e9b88fce5e9
#. default-sha256: c7e7c3e7f4a29daaec88e81b1015c01acb7c9f7ed8e66cbb85ff8b9cb91cdba9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4173736F_04DD_49B2_9A5D_5C6EF1B71BB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A rose...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫薔薇………？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78c704f25b705ec4548fdb9c8d7094a4bdf79f345e0b526952ae0679a0e2f79e
#. default-sha256: f0de8b369681f78bbcfb23b8d2ea41eb882afc58bddded1e4302c2729b7b0a9f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle had, over the past year, cleaned up the nest of weeds that had been "
"strangling the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫以前は雑草だらけだった庭も、⟪k:3⟫この一年でジゼルが綺麗にしていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8c41fb26caf6c75c975830b653655ffbbbad88547d045e572707601b3b04ad6
#. default-sha256: c4d4056491fc3425cb839d7876bebf3c6bd4aa10d2e7863c552d88820bb32927
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_67607DCF_55B6_47B9_9971_EAEC3EBE36E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Off to the side of a small plot of turned soil, swaying in the wind beneath the moonlight,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫小さな畑の傍らに、⟪k:1⟫月の光を浴びながら風に揺られていたのは――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859ffcf7d006d1ff35b05fa12cac12d43484167db171748684e362ebbadd479a
#. default-sha256: 652b62b969ce362002fa8b78efcec02eef2cc6786b5bbfea7172ebab28139e51
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8B661D88_6305_4E48_8429_E8E84ACFF805"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was a single red rose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一輪の、⟪k:1⟫赤い薔薇だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e7b90bc3e32a8be4106413079ce287205b73aad948759c372e573fc82096cff
#. default-sha256: b7d711b5ff13a7059dd681f7a2bf3427c493314c75bff89a7b1ee326b4ce5ef6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E7A14ADD_A07F_4B64_84C0_417D505E204A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When did you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いつの間に……、⟪k:1⟫こんな……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab8f677c79a3deb4dd79b1a3fa7070c260de08fe4d892963dfdb93e45e9b71c5
#. default-sha256: 83409ed32b8f94189717c12d01dbb25084e5716736121da6948f55bfc83bf552
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Last year, I requested flower seeds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I just couldn’t get them to grow,⟪k:3⟫and "
"I was starting to think they never would..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一年前に、⟪k:1⟫花の種をお願いしていたんです。⟪k:2⟫でも全然咲かなくて、⟪k:3⟫やっぱりダメだった"
"のかなって思っていたんですけど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cd5bfdb6ccd30b9e14e1b35452eecce170e61e06d3cb2fd143c140660894c3f
#. default-sha256: 60e582e5fb59c1468e7c244b58d0509396440eddb835b2553ca7f284f20ae303
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But look: it’s only one, but it did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ほら、⟪k:1⟫見てください。⟪k:2⟫たった一輪ですけど、⟪k:3⟫咲いたんです。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59d1021797dc87b997235e08daba088fff53700687827c913055428f8042e305
#. default-sha256: aadd9b3ecd3dc2fd0ad17d0e72cdb2f6444508beae76e70c638d31fe7096a0e6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3C367B04_7923_4F84_9389_FDCB52BD71D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...I had no idea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………知らなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b712eed2fe2482120c65e0ac1eb4a5efc4eee66d08858c4c3b612e64f1f7685f
#. default-sha256: 9eb97cc572919b0a9f2d6a6d8b8682bda6fea5a7fd2445e5397bcecc5e7b75e8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E128D5_962B_4B90_87DE_8DD815370172"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course you didn’t. I didn’t tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫だって、⟪k:2⟫言ってませんもの。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84a5f149be3e0247ffaeda4244b00ab174bbd909f24c427cce340578bad9e0c9
#. default-sha256: 51b01016197bfc8cb575de48fdbb718742fa20173dd43c22e04dee8a8f1faf39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A64047C7_A745_40A3_AAF1_E6A770DCA609"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why would you keep it from me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なぜ、⟪k:1⟫花のことを秘密に。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7a5701afbc57b3bb129296ad3db4f64c2168cb88da5102c655665b7d131df0e
#. default-sha256: 4d496afff88cdde409ba1acf428663098bc6eef0f43f4509ffc46c9074594a13
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73C9FBF1_FFE7_4BE4_B0A0_3F9DA390FD4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫to make it a gift for you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これは――、⟪k:1⟫わたしが旦那さまに贈ろうって思ったものなんです。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a165ffaa1b2b6f2fad79e96f043f29a2de2f80f51f46826743adab1d2bb67fee
#. default-sha256: db600c55d6a9ab2e53968c622b8c22c75adabf8d625b0fd21b1b8b30e81179a9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DC4F977F_5278_4FD4_A6FE_FE627B9A881B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What...? ⟪k:1⟫Why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……え。⟪k:1⟫………なんで。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8691e574a3b2faf375f05131963f01f30f68466d430c07bf2a45e9c29baa1653
#. default-sha256: 8dec61901e382481fbd97cbf43a3f83b84c33b6dc76f4d7c45e454b726381865
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roses make wonderful gifts, supposedly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫薔薇は――贈り物に良いらしんです。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08bf1b4e65afad43675e877aa27873bb7ed81a5add3d3bd22b7b5cc8bf71779c
#. default-sha256: 9c08dfc85a3074d2bc651385f35a626667c76d8366d13841e34793485699f07f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いや……、⟪k:1⟫そう、⟪k:2⟫ではなく――なぜ、⟪k:3⟫私に。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫私は貴女に何もやっていないの"
"に……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ad7e8f69162c44a726baeeca6f2c0594cf8b08959206b16b6e98dfbda9bdcce
#. default-sha256: 7e716324eae117a74dc76bc4d5e3e2fb298d9fe0ed10edbcad2a969f99b82515
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consider it... ⟪k:1⟫a symbol of my hope that we’ll still be this close another year from "
"now. ⟪k:2⟫If we are, then this is yours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一年後も――仲良くやれているように、⟪k:1⟫って願掛けの意味も込めて……かしら。⟪k:2⟫それが叶ったか"
"ら、⟪k:3⟫これはあなたのものです。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2215c871fa8d50dc1aa6da5bf25891439fa2ab365feb83a20719db1c779aecf5
#. default-sha256: 88997fdad2ea2ad7feb48de5e08e3e57761fc21d4dabdea015233cf4b6da74fc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow her reasoning...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（理屈がさっぱり分からない……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdc981755857bdcc7561dc2fa97bfa1277229e8545a5036d66d895616fbf5617
#. default-sha256: bb020abfe595273111cef08a6532656f44205c4ec35050d4bc484e5334cb404c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow it at all, but...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（分からない、⟪k:1⟫が―――）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91441f04a28ee03ed25082c0b59cbf17e2b0a23069b191228c9f75809a50c4a5
#. default-sha256: 01c88a938a9a8c45617d525edff357a6b18629183748bb80f5b621eff6917355
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...The sight of the deep red rose almost melting into the dark night was perhaps the most "
"wondrous thing I had ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫夜の暗闇に溶け込むような赤い薔薇は、⟪k:1⟫私が今まで見てきたどの光景よりも、⟪k:2⟫幻想的である"
"ように思えた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_12F92596_4849_4E96_BC08_4A9985D500EA
