msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When the wood panel he was using as a canvas and the charcoal in his hand crashed to the "
"hard chapel floor, the clattering was so loud I jumped."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼が取り落としたキャンパス代わりの木板や、⟪k:1⟫木炭は、⟪k:2⟫思った以上に大きい音をたてて、"
"⟪k:3⟫ステンドグラスの間に反響した。"

